<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>For special case use only.  Most cutscenes should use <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/CS%20LoadCutscene" title="CS LoadCutscene">CS_LoadCutscene</a>(), as most actor mappings can be handled from the cutscene editor itself.
</p>
